But `CONSOLE_SVG_FORMAT` is a large string with many `{}`.

If I make it an f-string, I have to change all `{` to `{{` and `}` to `}}` except for the ones I want to interpolate.

The current `CONSOLE_SVG_FORMAT` already has `{{` and `}}` for CSS.

